<p><span id="u-credit-00241" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00241" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00241-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nightingale-fz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6348925); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6348925&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608795983" alt="Nightingale_FZ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6348925)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nightingale-fz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6348925); return false;">Nightingale_FZ</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1591432139 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 Jun 2020 08:28</span></p>
